DNmZDI5Zjg1YzcxZWI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/8f53dd2d2a0defb8e83022252203fd29f85c71eb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/8f53dd2d2a0defb8e83022252203fd29f85c71eb","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-07-08T07:49:05Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-07-08T15:00:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"a7c153f5301678229cbd1858a0aef56ec914b192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/a7c153f5301678229cbd1858a0aef56ec914b192"},"message":"poll: use nodeview everywhere\n\nThere was a bug in HA subnet router handover where we used stale node data\nfrom the longpoll session that we handed to Connect. This meant that we got\nsome odd behaviour where routes would not be deactivated correctly.\n\nThis commit changes to the nodeview is used through out, and we load the\ncurrent node to be updated in the write path and then handle it all there\nto be consistent.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"4a8d2d9ed30d17db77b5703a0aeaef9c11e05eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4a8d2d9ed30d17db77b5703a0aeaef9c11e05eee","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4a8d2d9ed30d17db77b5703a0aeaef9c11e05eee"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAvIroq9RgqS+oRal8ukTSJtwPbRmF6g0ogE01ax/4SmLgN2OXdGlOQ0PqvK+95ewd\nROf4gDJOKWgNMklExv8w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree a7c153f5301678229cbd1858a0aef56ec914b192\nparent 4a8d2d9ed30d17db77b5703a0aeaef9c11e05eee\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1751960945 +0200\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1751986818 +0200\n\npoll: use nodeview everywhere\n\nThere was a bug in HA subnet router handover where we used stale node data\nfrom the longpoll session that we handed to Connect. This meant that we got\nsome odd behaviour where routes would not be deactivated correctly.\n\nThis commit changes to the nodeview is used through out, and we load the\ncurrent node to be updated in the write path and then handle it all there\nto be consistent.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n","verified_at":"2025-07-08T15:00:22Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":18528517647,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz886_bggZzwAAAARQYr4P","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/18528517647","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"8f53dd2d2a0defb8e83022252203fd29f85c71eb","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kradalby/headscale/commits/8f53dd2d2a0defb8e83022252203fd29f85c71eb","created_at":"2025-07-08T15:00:22Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2998046306,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz886yso5i","user":null,"body":null,"commit_id":"8f53dd2d2a0defb8e83022252203fd29f85c7